loading-tips =
    .a0 = Explore carefully. The unknown does not always announce itself.
    .a1 = Keep an eye on your hunger and thirst while exploring.
    .a2 = Not every secret in WILDRAFT can be found on the surface.
    .a3 = The world remembers those who venture too far.
    .a4 = Some places are safer than others. Learn to read the land.
    .a5 = Your weapon is only the beginning. What you discover is up to you.
    .a6 = Press '{ $gameinput-togglelantern }' to light your lantern.
    .a7 = You can type /say or /s to only chat with players directly around you.
    .a8 = Keep an eye out for food, chests and other loot spread all around the world!
    .a9 = Inventory filled with food? Try crafting better food from it!
    .a10 = Wondering what there is to do? Try out one of the dungeons marked on the map!
    .a11 = Sit near a campfire (with the '{ $gameinput-sit }' key) to slowly recover from your injuries.
    .a12 = Need more bags or better armor to continue your journey? Press '{ $gameinput-crafting }' to open the crafting menu!
    .a13 = Press '{ $gameinput-roll }' to roll. Rolling can be used to move faster and dodge enemy attacks.
    .a14 = You can take screenshots with '{ $gameinput-screenshot }'.
